low.func.def target<amd.xdna.aie2p.core> abi(object_function) @widened_product_chain_32(%left: reg<aie2p.vec256 x2>, %right: reg<aie2p.vec256 x2>, %other: reg<aie2p.vec256 x2>) -> (reg<aie2p.mbms x2>) asm {
